    "reviews": "\u201cPreserve sees you encourage natural symbiosis in a chill, relaxed puzzle game that asks you to layer nature up until it all works together\u201d<br>PCGamesN<br><br>\u201cIf you like cozy games, you should definitely add this one to your wishlist!\u201d<br>The Gamer's Lounge<br><br>\u201cLike Dorfromantik, Preserve so far strikes a perfect balance between relaxation and puzzles.\u201d<br>Inverse<br>",
